# Spotify Developer credentials
# Register your app at https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard
# Add "dialed://spotify-callback" as a Redirect URI in your app settings.
#
# Client Credentials (no user login) — enables: track search, audio-features
# User OAuth — additionally enables: /me/player/currently-playing polling
#
# Rename this file to .env and fill in your values.

EXPO_PUBLIC_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id_here
EXPO_PUBLIC_SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET=your_client_secret_here
